{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "af169ccd-7902-855f-a7ad-155a4d2f3dbf",
  "created_at": "2026-02-19T15:43:46-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Richard Peckham",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T15:41:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T15:41:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, pothole report. Intersection near me. It's been patched three times. Keeps reopening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T15:42:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, three patches and it keeps coming back. Sorry, you sound like you're in a tiled room, a bit of an echo."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T15:42:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bathroom. Best reception in the house. Echo's the price."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T15:42:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough, I can hear you fine. What's the location?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T15:42:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "77 Carroll Avenue. The hole's right at the corner there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T15:42:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "77 Carroll Avenue, at the intersection. Is that in the Fifth Ward area?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T15:42:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T15:42:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And can you tell me about the size, or what it's doing right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T15:42:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Full of water. Hard to see. Cars drop right into it before the driver knows."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T15:42:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's filled with water and tough to spot, especially for drivers. That's worth getting flagged as a hazard. And you said it's been patched three times already?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T15:42:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three. Cold patch, I think. Holds a couple weeks, then gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T15:43:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll put that in the report, repeated patching at the same spot, water-filled, hard to see. I'll send it to the road crew supervisor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T15:43:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Can I get a reference number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T15:43:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, let me pull it up. [pause] Okay, it's request number 4471. That's four, four, seven, one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T15:43:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four four seven one. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T15:43:25-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want a call back when it's been looked at? I have a number here ending in zero one five zero."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T15:43:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Call that one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T15:43:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Anything else I can do for you today, Mr. Peckham?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T15:43:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. That's it. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T15:43:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
